      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Studio Bot · Calendar feed\nServes the schedule as an iCalendar feed that Google Calendar, Apple Calendar and Outlook can subscribe to. Postgres stays the source of truth; calendars only read.\n\nThe link needs the secret token from `studio.settings`. Add `&room=<id>` or `&trainer=<id>` for one room or one trainer; the bot hands out ready-made links under **Calendar**.\n\nTell the bot where this webhook lives: `SELECT studio.setup(calendar_url => 'https://<your n8n>/webhook/studio-calendar');`",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
